# Ollama Docker

Docker container for running Ollama locally with persistent model storage.

## Quick Start
# Build the Docker image
make build

# Download Ollama (if needed)
make dlOllama

# Start Ollama server (detached with volume)
make runDS

# Stop the server
make stopDS

# Open shell in container
make sh

# View container status
make s

# View logs
make lAll

## Usage
# Pull and run a model
ollama pull llama3.2
ollama run llama3.2

# API access at http://localhost:11434

